{R}_{3}+2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}0 & 3 & 2 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 6 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 7 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLooking at the row echelon form, we see that $P$ has $3$ pivots, and therefore the number of pivot columns is $3.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-73633/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1073953e-7e0a-5237-8533-8882b7772741"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-73633"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130959/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "914067c0-13ad-511e-b61b-50b0153d8605" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130959/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "46f87b12-aa55-5175-986e-44c48329bfa4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130959/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "437f1f44-b467-57c9-946b-cc7dcac07466" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130959/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "2b24aa5a-324a-5658-8cd3-f24c9a9f78c1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130959/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "0ff97fba-0c60-507f-9342-2463198e827e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130959/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "58ee628d-4e2b-5f95-b082-e353b09927e3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-130959/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer-fi